+    ``num_attention_heads`` query heads, ``num_key_value_heads`` KV heads,
+    ``head_dim`` per head). The only difference is that K and V are read out of
+    a shared low-rank latent rather than projected directly:
+
+        c = kv_down_proj(x)            # hidden_size -> mla_kv_lora_rank
+        k = k_up_proj(c), v = v_up_proj(c)   # rank -> num_kv_heads * head_dim
+
+    ``x`` is the verifier ``target_hidden`` for context positions and the draft
